<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fast M1 macro for Deepwoken (autoclick)</Major>
    <Description>I have this exact macro on autohotkey, but as it doesn't work anymore, I decided to make it here!

When activated, just go in game and let it do the job for you, it swings very fast, basically like an autoclicker, and while activated, you can still dodge (Q) and PARRY (F)

This basically removes the endlag from your weapon (OP WITH DAGGERS AND LOW SWINGSPEED WEAPONS LIKE  WARDEN CEREMONIAL SWORD)

this macro is not bannable and is allowed, so do not worry!

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 

:)</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
